Welcome to Ledgebrook Service Desk. 

Short About: 
Submit Ledgebrook Service Desk requests to Jira directly from Slack.

Use /servicedesk to create a ticket. Choose the category that best fits, add a concise summary and details, then submit when ready. 
The app checks for matching open tickets before creating a new one.

Current form helper text: 
Use one ticket per request. If unsure, submit your best description and Service Desk can redirect it. 
